about.body:
Try Omarchy {version}

Run the Omarchy desktop on Windows. Your files persist between sessions.

Originally created by @martiano. Maintained under Omacom.

Website: {website}
Source, help and issue reporting: {source}

Open source under the MIT License. Built with Omarchy, Arch Linux and QEMU.

Launcher updates and Linux updates are separate. For Linux packages and Omarchy, use Update > Omarchy inside the desktop.

